encoding  utf-8
survey 2008

input 100Fathom/100Fathom.th
input ChillOutChoke/ChillOutChoke.th
input TimeLine/TimeLine.th
input RockNRoll/RockNRoll.th

equate 1.0@100Fathom 1.17@TimeLine
equate 1.0@RockNRoll 1.36@ChillOutChoke
equate 1.27@100Fathom 1.62@RockNRoll

map 2008M
  ChillOutChokeM@ChillOutChoke
  RockNRollM@RockNRoll
  100FathomM@100Fathom
  TimeLineM@TimeLine
endmap

join ChillOutChokeSPl5@ChillOutChoke RockNRollSPl1@RockNRoll -smooth on
join RockNRollSPl3@RockNRoll 100FathomSPl1@100Fathom -smooth on
join TimeLineSPl2@TimeLine 100FathomSPl1@100Fathom -smooth on
join TimeLineSPl1@TimeLine 100FathomSPl2@100Fathom -smooth on 

endsurvey

